description.en:
The ID of the model to use. If omitted, the system defaults to the Qwen 3 Homework-Enhanced model (`qwen3-32b-offline-202506171456-fb65`). Available models:

```json
[
  {
      "ModelName": "Qwen 3 Homework-Enhanced Model",
      "ModelId": "qwen3-32b-offline-202506171456-fb65"
  },
  {
      "ModelName": "Qwen Correction Fine-tuned Model",
      "ModelId": "qwen-correction-v2"
  },
  {
      "ModelName": "Qwen Custom Correction Model",
      "ModelId": "qwen-custom-correction-v1"
  }
]
```
